tools/MCMC_GPU.py
tools/mcmc_gpu_v_2.py
# stray editor duplicates
* copy.py

# ==================== V0.6.0-GREY ====================
# the bilingual user manuals (manual/*.md) ship in git — verified that no
# existing rule matches them (the blanket *.dat/*.png/*.pdf rules don't).
# release image referenced at the end of README.md; defensive keep in case a
# *.jpg rule is ever added later (none exists today)
!source/GREY.jpg
# local Claude Code session config
.claude/
# internal correspondence draft (kept local, like the V0.5.1 dev notes)
EMAIL_to_Oguri.txt

